      "type": "Field Note",
      "title": "The Limits of AI: Geospatial Foundation Models Do Not Understand Geography",
      "tags": [
        "GeoAI",
        "Geospatial Foundation Models",
        "Geographic Reasoning"
      ],
      "read": "6 min · interactive",
      "excerpt": "Geospatial foundation models can learn powerful spatial representations. Their harder test is geographic reasoning: scale, spatial dependence, regional heterogeneity, mechanism, and transfer beyond familiar places.",
